# The snapshot is READ BY `sha256sum -c`, which treats a trailing CR as part of
# the FILENAME. On a core.autocrlf=true clone (every Windows checkout here) that
# makes all nine entries fail to open — reported identically to real drift, so
# the reproducer would refuse to run and blame the artefact set. Pin to LF.
A11_SNAPSHOT.sha256 text eol=lf
run_certification.sh text eol=lf
